  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7455e1b1af245b34c95fc9187c26d9ad, type: 3}
  m_Name: KingIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: The King
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue:
  - You dare enter my throne room? You must be the fool delivering those wretched
    packets.
  - Do you know how long I have been waiting? My patience has run out long ago.
  - But fine. A deal is a deal. Here is your payment for the deliveries.
  - "*The king tosses a single gold coin at your feet.*"
  - One yen. That is more than generous for the likes of you.
  - What? You look upset. You should be grateful I am paying you at all.
  - Guards! This ungrateful messenger needs to be taught some manners.
